    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.2,
      435.44,
      295.38,
      493.52
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act. as amended by the Land Acquisition(Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Governmentintends to acquire the following land/servitude. which isrequired for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      64.32,
      502.63,
      278.05,
      512.71
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land or servitude to be acquired :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.2,
      521.84,
      295.45,
      591.92
    ],
    "text": "Depicted as lot number in the Preliminary Plan No. R/EMB/2018/181 and 03.01.2019 dated, prepared by the SurveyorGeneral situated in the Vllage of Andoluwa in DiayapotaGampattuwa Minor Division in the Embilipitiya DivisionalSecretary's Division in Rathnapura District, SabaragamuwaProvince, Number, extent and bounded as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.2,
      602.24,
      295.71,
      624.36
    ],
    "text": "1. Lot No. 899 \u2013 Karamatiye Yaya \u2013 Extent: about 12.1497Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.2,
      631.03,
      295.49,
      653.11
    ],
    "text": "North: Lot Nos. 889, 115, 473, 480, 475, 476, 477, 481, 500,485 and 501; East: Lot Nos. 500, 485, 501, 507, 510, 895, 512",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.2,
      355.03,
      547.14,
      377.12
    ],
    "text": "and 513; South: Lot Nos. 510, 895, 512, 513 and 889; West: LotNo. 889.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.2,
      392.48,
      547.73,
      528.56
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on whicha servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appearpersonally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before meat Embilipitiya Divisional Secretary's Office on the 06th dayof March, 2019 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested tonotify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 27th dayof February, 2019 the nature of their interests in the land, theparticulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisitionof the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation andthe details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
